# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Applied at the edge, no build step involved.
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# /refer was a separate landing page for word of mouth traffic. Its content is
# now folded into the homepage (who teaches it, where this is headed, how it
# runs, and the richer enquiry form), so the page itself is gone. These rules
# keep every link a family was ever given, and anything Google indexed,
# landing somewhere real. 301 because the move is permanent.
#
# Both spellings are needed. A splat does not match the bare path above it.
/refer / 301
/refer/ / 301
/refer/* / 301
